=== tm-1: DATE MAX > YYYYMMDD on a CTE_LOOKUP child ===
== Query ==
WITH c AS (SELECT grp AS k, MAX(d) AS mx FROM ctm GROUP BY grp) SELECT g.k AS k, c.mx AS mx FROM ctk AS g JOIN c ON c.k = g.k WHERE c.mx > 19950101;

Number of output lines, including header: 3

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
WITH c AS (SELECT grp AS k, MAX(d) AS mx FROM ctm GROUP BY grp) SELECT g.k AS k, c.mx AS mx FROM ctk AS g JOIN c ON c.k = g.k WHERE c.mx > 19950101|
k	mx
2	1996-06-15
3	2024-03-05

